    {
      "text": "San Mateo County AHF predevelopment pipeline, September 2024: 2809 ECR (Alta Housing): 50 total units, 26% at 15-30% AMI and 74% at 31-60% AMI.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001649"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alta Housing presentation to the North Fair Oaks Community Council (September 25, 2025): Magnolia provides 51 affordable senior units, 25% for extremely low-income households, with on-site parking, next to Alta's Fair Oaks Commons. Committed funding: $983K from the County of San Mateo and $1M from Senator Josh Becker; Alta will apply for more county funds in 2026. Timeline: county funding 2026, state funding 2027, building permits 2027, tax credit funding 2028, construction start February 2029, construction end and move-in 2030.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003467"
      ]
    }
